Section 2. Definitions- (ix) 'misbranded'- an article of food shall be deemed to be misbranded- (k) if it is not labelled in accordance with the requirements of this Act or rules made thereunder;
(x) "package" means a box, bottle, casket, tin, barrel, case, receptacle, sack, bag, wrapper or other thing other which an article of food is placed or packed.
